# Vercel CLI uploads every file that is not ignored here. Its built-in list skips
# .env.local and .env.*.local but NOT a plain .env, so keep local secrets and
# bulky local-only files out of deployment uploads. Production values live in the
# Vercel project's environment variables.
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
.wallets-addresses.txt
design/raw
contracts/lib
contracts/out
contracts/cache
contracts/broadcast
scripts/out
docs/08-SLIDES.pdf
docs/08-SLIDES.html
